      "message": "fix(sim): skip open region rims in boundary tangency with a model\n\nIn Mode::Boundary with a model, filter cx.region edges through\nedge_is_wall in tangency so open outer rims do not convict Face moves\nthat end near them after lifting over a hole. Keep checking all\nsection edges and keep checking walls standing below the model top.\n\nFixes #2657",
